   "locked": false,
   "text": "We focus on physician agreeableness, which reflects\ncompassion, respectfulness, and trust toward others.\nMore agreeable physicians may be more willing to\naccommodate requests for patient demands. …",
   "originalText": "We focus on physician agreeableness, which reflects\ncompassion, respectfulness, and trust toward others.\nMore agreeable physicians may be more willing to\naccommodate requests for patient demands. …",
