   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. Fold one panel: click ▾ / ▸ on its Runs title.\n2. Fold all panels: the Focus toggle in the Page bar (shortcut: F).\n3. A run that needs you never pops open: the bar or badge turns green instead.\n4. The content card takes the freed space.\n5. Your choice is remembered in this browser, per Space.",
   "originalText": "1. Fold one panel: click ▾ / ▸ on its Runs title.\n2. Fold all panels: the Focus toggle in the Page bar (shortcut: F).\n3. A run that needs you never pops open: the bar or badge turns green instead.\n4. The content card takes the freed space.\n5. Your choice is remembered in this browser, per Space.",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
